  "title": "Sandie&#39;s Seven-Layer Bean Dip",
  "description": "Refried beans, ground beef, sour cream, tomatoes, and Mexican cheese-blend are baked into a crowd-pleasing 7-layer dip; serve with tortilla chips.",
  "authors": [
    "Kenys B"
  ],
